cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: ANTs N4 bias field correction
abstract: Corrects the low-frequency intensity non-uniformity (bias field) of T1-weighted MRI with N4BiasFieldCorrection
  from ANTs, optionally restricted to a brain mask. Writes the corrected image and the estimated bias
  field per subject.
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
repository-code: https://github.com/pennsieve-apps/processor-ants-n4
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
- neuroimaging
- mri
- nifti
- ants
- n4
